  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your necromental servants are inured to negative energies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Grave Elemental<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat when you summon multiple elementals. If you summon only a single elemental, you add twice your mythic tier to its energy resistance against negative energy and a bonus equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to its saving throws against death effects, energy drain, negative energy, and necromantic effects, and to the save DC of its chill touch special attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
